### 18. 코드 재사용 시도 ← 400 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "{{inviteCode}}"
}

### 19. 존재하지 않는 코드 입력 ← 400 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "WS-FAKE-CODE"
}

### 20. MANAGER가 join-team 호출 ← 403 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/join-team
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

{
  "inviteCode": "WS-FAKE-CODE"
}

### 21. EMPLOYEE가 invite-code 호출 ← 403 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/invite-code
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

### 22. 미인증으로 invite-code 호출 ← 401 기대
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/invite-code
Content-Type: application/json

